===Noun===
{{en-noun}}
[[File:Flying_squirrel_in_a_tree.jpg|thumb|A flying squirrel gliding among branches.]]

# Any of 43 [[species]] of squirrels, most from the tribe {{taxlink|Pteromyini|tribe|noshow=1|ver=161006}}, others from family [[Anomaluridae]], which [[glide]] from tree to tree.

